# The function is called once, from the body of the module. Its scope is never made: token and limit are numbers and lie among the variables of the module.
# scan and next hold nothing but that scope, and the function asks at its entry whether it has been entered before.
# The closure of scan that scanner hands out could be let go with the arrows over it: whoever holds it as a value goes on capturing it.
